WEBVTT

00:43:59.954 --> 00:44:01.829
Yeah, well, you know, the reason
I thought it would be

00:44:01.829 --> 00:44:06.829
a collection of essays is I thought there
is no way in hell that I can write

00:44:06.829 --> 00:44:12.579
a book while having two little babies
and being in financial stress.

00:44:12.579 --> 00:44:15.746
And, you know, all of this. I just thought
, I can't write another book.

00:44:16.746 --> 00:44:22.163
And what happened is I started writing
and then it went on and on and on and

00:44:22.163 --> 00:44:24.996
on. And I was like, oh, I have
a bigger story to tell.

00:44:25.329 --> 00:44:31.163
And it really I didn't know that until I
was doing the writing because I found